  "bodyHash": "b0c7d23c0e7cf8f0",
  "content": "\n\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>此資源包需要&nbsp;</strong><strong><a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/cit-resewn\" rel=\"nofollow\">CIT Resewn</a>&nbsp;或&nbsp;</strong><a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/linkout?remoteUrl=https://optifine.net/downloads\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>Optifine。</strong></a><img src=\"https://www.google.com/url?sa=i&url=https://www.minecraft.net/es-es&psig=AOvVaw1beQ4oKU12Z-dWnmlBcQwr&ust=1694627978164000&source=images&cd=vfe&opi=89978449&ved=0CBAQjRxqFwoTCMiR7KbTpYEDFQAAAAAdAAAAABAE\" alt=\"\" width=\"Infinity\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/C3uOqM8.png\" alt=\"標題\" width=\"1481\" height=\"408\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif;font-size:24px\"><strong>耐久度降低。裂痕更多。</strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;<span style=\"font-size:18px\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif\">&nbsp;<strong style=\"font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif\">Breaking Armor </strong>是一款資源包，當盔甲耐久度下降時會為盔甲紋理增加更多細節。盔甲的外觀會隨其當前狀態而改變。&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif;font-size:18px\">適用於所有原版盔甲（包括海龜殼頭盔）。</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif;font-size:14px\">兼容版本：1.13 至最新版本。</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/eEHPkNK.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1481\" height=\"85\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>🔋 盔甲耐久度階段&nbsp;🔋</strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">&nbsp;&nbsp;</span>&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong><span style=\"color:#000\"><span style=\"font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif\">100%&nbsp;</span></span></strong><span style=\"color:#000;font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif\">初始外觀 &gt;&nbsp;</span><strong><span style=\"color:#000;font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif\">80%&nbsp;</span></strong><span style=\"color:#000\"><span style=\"font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif\">極細微裂痕 &gt;&nbsp;</span></span><strong><span style=\"color:#000\"><span style=\"font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif\">60%&nbsp;</span></span></strong><span style=\"color:#000\"><span style=\"font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif\">明顯裂痕 &gt;&nbsp;</span></span><strong><span style=\"color:#000\"><span style=\"font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif\">40%&nbsp;</span></span></strong><span style=\"color:#000\"><span style=\"font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif\">破損 &gt;&nbsp;</span></span><strong><span style=\"color:#000\"><span style=\"font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif\">10%&nbsp;</span></span></strong><span style=\"color:#000\"><span style=\"font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif\">我現在就需要修復！</span></span></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><span style=\"color:#000\"><span style=\"font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/Rwnf6Ek.gif\" alt=\"盔甲耐久度範例\" width=\"1481\" height=\"656\"><br></span></span></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/eEHPkNK.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1481\" height=\"85\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>🛠️ 模組相容性&nbsp;🛠️</strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;<span style=\"font-size:14px\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/additional-additions\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif\">Additional Additions</span></a></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif\">更多即將推出...</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;<span style=\"font-size:14px\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;color:#930\">未來我會加入更多模組的支援。如果你希望在 Breaking Armor 中看到自己喜愛的模組，請在留言區告知 :)</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;color:#930\">（我將優先考慮具有原版模型的盔甲）。</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;<br><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/eEHPkNK.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1481\" height=\"85\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>⚠️ 免責聲明 ⚠️</strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif\">Breaking Armor 的設計初衷是為了為盔甲增添更多視覺層次，並非針對競技用途。</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif\">部分 PVP 伺服器不允許使用此類資源包，若你打算在公開 PVP 伺服器上使用，請自行承擔風險。</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;color:#f00\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/eEHPkNK.png\" width=\"1481\" height=\"85\"></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;color:#f00\">與具有不同藝術風格的其他資源包不相容。</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">歡迎將 Breaking Armor 收錄於你的模組包中。請務必註明出處，</span><span style=\"font-size:14px\">切勿宣稱該資源包為你自行製作。</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">所有美術與紋理修改均由我（RPorotos）完成。</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>",
